<title>NIGERIA: Turnover up at Nigerian-German Chemicals Plc.</title>
<headline>Turnover up at Nigerian-German Chemicals Plc.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Nigerian-German Chemicals Plc to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Turnover		  471.1  vs 314.8</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  66.3 vs   65</p>
<p> Taxation		    19.8 vs   22.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   46.4 vs   42.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Nigerian-German Chemicals Plc was formerly Nigerian Hoechst. It said in a statement that despite an increase of 33 percent in turnover, profit rose just slightly because of falling margin. ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
